// Eastern Carnival: Zara (Batch 22)
@1 = ~Mmm. Mhm! Mhmm?~
@2 = ~I do not understand what you're trying to say.~
@3 = ~MHMMMM.~
@4 = ~Time to go~
@5 = ~Mhmm! Mhhhm. Hmhmm!~
@6 = ~Mhmm. Mmmm.~
@7 = ~Mhmm?~
@8 = ~Oh, I get you. You are a seller. Show me your goods.~
@9 = ~Time to go.~
@10 = ~It is indeed rare for a mummy to be... socialising with people. Let us remain calm however. I do not trust the undead.~
@11 = ~If you told me I'm going to trade with a mummy some day, I would not believe you. Travelling with you surely has its perks.~
@12 = ~By Tempus. Who would even think of keeping a mummy on a Carnival full of people. I wouldn't take that risk if I were responsible for this place.~
@13 = ~I would rather bash it's skull in than converse with it.~
@14 = ~(notices Zara eyeing him) I bet, my sweet that you were a woman of refined tastes and desires in your life. Trust me, I can read you like an open book. Not that your beauty went awry… it's... still there… covered in bandages. Beauty is important on the outside too… I meant.~
@15 = ~I found myself feel uncomfortable out of sudden. We, wood elves believe the undead to be the ultimate sin against the natural order and a violation of the sacred cycle of life, death, and rebirth. Seeing one being so eager to trade rather than jump at us with their claws is… extraordinary.~
@16 = ~Phi. Simple words cannot measure how vile and disgusting it is to even breathe the same air this undead thing does. Make your trade fast. I wish to leave.~
@17 = ~Do me a favour, <CHARNAME> and annihilate this mummy. It's stench vexes my nostrils.~
@18 = ~You truly have a knack for discovering uncanny events, <CHARNAME>. I'll give you that. Nevertheless, I'd rather we continue our journey towards our imminent doom elsewhere.~
@19 = ~I really, really, really hope we can go back to... whatever we were doing moments ago. Surely there are tents around here with more 'alive' vendors, who don't look like death itself.~
@20 = ~Can't decide whether it's horrifying or simply eccentric but I feel like I shouldn't entertain such thoughts any more.~
